# GuardianAI Docker Ignore Specification
# Purpose: Excludes unnecessary local artifacts, node_modules, virtual environments, and secrets from Docker build contexts.

# Node.js & Frontend Artifacts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.output
**/.vite

# Python & Virtual Environments
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/venv
**/env
**/.pytest_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# Local Databases & Logs
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/logs/*.log

# Local Environment Secrets & IDE
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/*.md
